WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.670
Heat a sealed metal can
of air and it can burst.

2
00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:05.270
So never try it.

3
00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:06.690
But think about this.

4
00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:08.470
The can is sealed.

5
00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:10.890
Nothing got in, and nothing got out.

6
00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:14.150
So what is pushing on its
walls from the inside?

7
00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.090
Do the particles grow bigger?

8
00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:18.730
In this mission, you'll
name the changes of state,

9
00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:21.370
from melting to sublimation.

10
00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:25.130
You'll find out why the mass
stays the same when ice melts.

11
00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:29.690
You'll see what gas pressure really
is, and how a smell spreads.

12
00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:33.490
Your mission: explain what
pushes on the walls of a heated

13
00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:35.070
sealed can.
